# Serial, not parallel. Running eslint and prettier concurrently over a staged
# Next.js diff was enough to get eslint killed for memory on a developer
# machine. lint-staged then rolls the working tree back and fails the commit,
# which reads as a lint error rather than an out-of-memory kill and passes on
# a plain retry — the worst kind of failure, because it teaches you to retry
# instead of to look.
npx lint-staged --concurrent 1
